My quick take:
SWEC is a fairly established women’s engineering college in Hyderabad, with particular relevance if you're looking at CSE/AI/ML/Data Science/IT. 
Its NAAC A++ status, autonomy, NBA accreditation and recent technical activities are notable positives.
For deciding whether it's actually good for you, though, I'd look separately at branch-wise placements, average package, highest package, faculty,
campus life, fees, internships, and how it compares with other Hyderabad colleges rather than relying on the college's own claims alone.
